{"title":"2018 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CRITICAL_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CRITICAL THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Detailed)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Detailed)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The harmonic mean of a set of non-zero numbers is the reciprocal of the average of the reciprocals of the numbers. What is the harmonic mean of 1, 2, and 4?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/7/ed7dec43ce45e400c68a87a7c6b83c72267466db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{3}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{7}{12}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{12}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{7}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\frac{7}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"390\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the reciprocals is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c0b9abe3de1864aaecb004fbea375fdb6e08a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1} + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}= \\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"123\" height=\"38\" />. Their average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a2370a3e7c4737d9b84d5546ce132105975dc476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />. Taking the reciprocal of this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/4/89445326cc609bd85c1daa2364485d2085b88359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{12}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"69\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~Flexo3168\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CRITICAL_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CRITICAL_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CRITICAL THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CRITICAL THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zlmUJMwHpqk\">https://youtu.be/zlmUJMwHpqk</a>\n</p><p>~EzLx\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Detailed.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Detailed)\">Video Solution (Detailed)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Detailed)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=2935\">https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=2935</a>\n</p><p>~OmegaLearn (Sohil Rathi)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PA9X-2xLuxY\">https://youtu.be/PA9X-2xLuxY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8\" title=\"2018 AMC 8\">2018 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_8